) VALUES (
    'history-of-biathlon',
    '{"en": "History of Biathlon: From Military Patrol to Precision Sport", "de": "Geschichte des Biathlons: Von der Militärpatrouille zum Präzisionssport", "fr": "Histoire du biathlon : De la patrouille militaire au sport de précision", "it": "Storia del biathlon: Dalla pattuglia militare allo sport di precisione", "es": "Historia del biatlón: De la patrulla militar al deporte de precisión", "pt": "História do biatlo: Da patrulha militar ao esporte de precisão", "nl": "Geschiedenis van de biathlon: Van militaire patrouille tot precisiesport", "ar": "تاريخ البياثلون: من الدورية العسكرية إلى رياضة الدقة", "ja": "バイアスロンの歴史：軍事パトロールから精密スポーツへ", "zh": "Dongji Liangxiang Lishi: Cong Junshi Xunluo dao Jingzhun Yundong", "ko": "바이애슬론의 역사: 군사 순찰에서 정밀 스포츠로"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Biathlon combines cross-country skiing with rifle shooting, creating one of winter sports'' most demanding and dramatic competitions. Its origins in military training shaped a unique athletic challenge.", "de": "Biathlon kombiniert Langlauf mit Gewehrschießen und schafft einen der anspruchsvollsten Wettkämpfe im Wintersport.", "fr": "Le biathlon combine le ski de fond avec le tir à la carabine, créant l''une des compétitions les plus exigeantes des sports d''hiver.", "it": "Il biathlon combina lo sci di fondo con il tiro a segno con la carabina, creando una delle competizioni più impegnative degli sport invernali.", "es": "El biatlón combina el esquí de fondo con el tiro con rifle, creando una de las competiciones más exigentes de los deportes de invierno.", "pt": "O biatlo combina esqui cross-country com tiro de rifle, criando uma das competições mais exigentes dos esportes de inverno.", "nl": "Biathlon combineert langlaufen met geweerschieten, waardoor het een van de meest veeleisende wintersporten is.", "ar": "يجمع البياثلون بين التزلج الريفي والرماية بالبندقية، مما يخلق واحدة من أكثر المسابقات إثارة في الرياضات الشتوية", "ja": "バイアスロンはクロスカントリースキーとライフル射撃を組み合わせ、ウィンタースポーツで最も要求の厳しい競技の一つを作り出しています。", "zh": "Dongji liangxiang jiehe yueye huaxue he buqiang sheji, chuangzao le dongji yundong zhong zui yanke de bisai zhiyi.", "ko": "바이애슬론은 크로스컨트리 스키와 소총 사격을 결합하여 동계 스포츠에서 가장 까다로운 경기 중 하나를 만들어냅니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> stands alone among winter sports, demanding both explosive endurance and ice-cold precision. Athletes ski at maximum effort, then must calm their racing hearts to hit targets smaller than a golf ball from 50 meters away.</p><h2>Military Origins</h2><p>The roots of biathlon lie in Scandinavian military training, where soldiers needed to move quickly on skis while carrying and using weapons. The earliest recorded skiing and shooting competition took place in 1767 between Norwegian and Swedish military units.</p><p>Throughout the 18th and 19th centuries, Nordic countries used ski-equipped troops for winter warfare. The combination of rapid movement and accurate shooting was a matter of life and death on the battlefield.</p><h2>Military Patrol</h2><p>Biathlon first appeared at the Winter Games in 1924 as \"military patrol,\" a team event combining skiing, shooting, and mountain climbing. Teams of four soldiers raced 30 kilometers while shooting at targets along the route.</p><p>Military patrol was a demonstration sport, reflecting the military nature of the competition. After World War II, there was international desire to create a civilian version of the sport.</p><h2>Modern Biathlon Emerges</h2><p>The Union Internationale de Pentathlon Moderne et Biathlon (UIPMB) took over governance in 1948, and the first official world championships were held in 1958 in Austria. The sport transitioned from military exercise to civilian competition.</p><p>The International Biathlon Union (IBU) was founded in 1993, becoming the sport''s independent governing body and establishing the World Cup series that would transform biathlon into a major spectator sport.</p><h2>Equipment Evolution</h2><p>Early biathlon used full-bore military rifles, which were heavy and dangerous. The transition to .22 caliber rifles in the 1970s made the sport safer and more accessible. Modern biathlon rifles weigh about 3.5 kg and athletes carry them on their backs throughout the race.</p><p>Target systems evolved from paper to mechanical to electronic, allowing instant feedback on hits and misses that dramatically increased spectator appeal.</p><h2>World Cup Era</h2><p>The IBU World Cup, launched in 1977, created a season-long drama that attracted huge television audiences, particularly in Germany, Norway, and France. Venues like <a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva</a>, <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a>, and <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> became cathedrals of the sport.</p><p>Legends like Ole Einar Bjørndalen, Martin Fourcade, and <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> elevated biathlon to new heights, their duels on the shooting range and ski tracks captivating millions of fans.</p><h2>Women''s Biathlon</h2><p>Women''s biathlon world championships began in 1984, and women''s events were included in the 1992 Games. Athletes like Magdalena Forsberg, Tora Berger, and modern stars like <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a> and <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a> have proven that women''s biathlon is equally thrilling.</p><h2>The Modern Sport</h2><p>Today''s biathlon includes individual, sprint, pursuit, mass start, and relay events. Athletes ski up to 20 kilometers while completing two or four shooting stages, alternating between prone and standing positions.</p><p>The sport''s unique drama—where a single missed shot can cost a medal—makes every race unpredictable and exciting until the final meters.</p>", "de": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> steht allein unter den Wintersportarten und erfordert sowohl explosive Ausdauer als auch eiskalte Präzision.</p><h2>Militärische Ursprünge</h2><p>Die Wurzeln des Biathlons liegen im skandinavischen Militärtraining, wo Soldaten sich schnell auf Skiern bewegen und gleichzeitig Waffen tragen und benutzen mussten.</p><h2>Militärpatrouille</h2><p>Biathlon erschien erstmals 1924 bei den Winterspielen als \"Militärpatrouille\", ein Mannschaftswettbewerb.</p><h2>Weltcup-Ära</h2><p>Der IBU Weltcup wurde 1977 ins Leben gerufen. Austragungsorte wie <a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Antholz</a> und <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> wurden zu Kathedralen des Sports.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> se distingue parmi les sports d''hiver, exigeant à la fois une endurance explosive et une précision glaciale.</p><h2>Origines militaires</h2><p>Les racines du biathlon se trouvent dans l''entraînement militaire scandinave, où les soldats devaient se déplacer rapidement à ski tout en portant et utilisant des armes.</p><h2>Patrouille militaire</h2><p>Le biathlon est apparu pour la première fois aux Jeux d''hiver de 1924 sous le nom de \"patrouille militaire\".</p><h2>Ère de la Coupe du monde</h2><p>Des sites comme <a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva</a> et <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> sont devenus des cathédrales du sport.</p>", "it": "<p>Il <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biathlon</a> si distingue tra gli sport invernali, richiedendo sia resistenza esplosiva che precisione glaciale.</p><h2>Origini militari</h2><p>Le radici del biathlon sono nell''addestramento militare scandinavo, dove i soldati dovevano muoversi rapidamente sugli sci portando e usando armi.</p><h2>Pattuglia militare</h2><p>Il biathlon apparve per la prima volta ai Giochi invernali del 1924 come \"pattuglia militare\".</p><h2>Era della Coppa del Mondo</h2><p>Sedi come <a href=\"/anterselva-venue-guide/\">Anterselva</a> e <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> sono diventate cattedrali dello sport.</p>", "es": "<p>El <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlón</a> destaca entre los deportes de invierno, exigiendo tanto resistencia explosiva como precisión helada.</p><h2>Orígenes militares</h2><p>Las raíces del biatlón están en el entrenamiento militar escandinavo.</p>", "pt": "<p>O <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">biatlo</a> se destaca entre os esportes de inverno, exigindo tanto resistência explosiva quanto precisão gelada.</p><h2>Origens militares</h2><p>As raízes do biatlo estão no treinamento militar escandinavo.</p>", "nl": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Biathlon</a> onderscheidt zich van andere wintersporten door zowel explosief uithoudingsvermogen als ijskoude precisie te vereisen.</p><h2>Militaire oorsprong</h2><p>De wortels van biathlon liggen in Scandinavische militaire training.</p>", "ar": "<p>يتميز <a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">البياثلون</a> بين الرياضات الشتوية، حيث يتطلب قدرة تحمل انفجارية ودقة باردة كالجليد.</p><h2>الأصول العسكرية</h2><p>تعود جذور البياثلون إلى التدريب العسكري الاسكندنافي.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">バイアスロン</a>は、爆発的な持久力と氷のような精密さの両方を要求し、ウィンタースポーツの中でも独自の地位を占めています。</p><h2>軍事的起源</h2><p>バイアスロンのルーツは、兵士がスキーで素早く移動しながら武器を携帯・使用する必要があったスカンジナビアの軍事訓練にあります。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">Dongji liangxiang</a> zai dongji yundong zhong duyishu, yaoqiu baofaxing naili he bingleng de jingzhundu.</p><h2>Junshi qiyuan</h2><p>Dongji liangxiang de genben zaiyu Sigandinawiya de junshi xunlian.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/biathlon-guide/\">바이애슬론</a>은 폭발적인 지구력과 얼음같은 정밀함을 모두 요구하며 동계 스포츠 중에서 독보적인 위치를 차지합니다.</p><h2>군사적 기원</h2><p>바이애슬론의 뿌리는 스칸디나비아 군사 훈련에 있습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'BT',
    '{"en": "History of biathlon - From military patrol origins to modern World Cup, discover how skiing and shooting combined to create one of winter sports'' most demanding competitions.", "de": "Geschichte des Biathlons - Von militärischen Ursprüngen zum modernen Weltcup.", "fr": "Histoire du biathlon - Des origines de patrouille militaire à la Coupe du monde moderne.", "it": "Storia del biathlon - Dalle origini della pattuglia militare alla moderna Coppa del Mondo.", "es": "Historia del biatlón - Desde los orígenes de la patrulla militar hasta la Copa del Mundo moderna.", "pt": "História do biatlo - Das origens da patrulha militar à Copa do Mundo moderna.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van biathlon - Van militaire patrouille oorsprong tot moderne Wereldbeker.", "ar": "تاريخ البياثلون - من أصول الدورية العسكرية إلى كأس العالم الحديث", "ja": "バイアスロンの歴史 - 軍事パトロールの起源から現代のワールドカップまで", "zh": "Dongji liangxiang lishi - Cong junshi xunluo qiyuan dao xiandai Shijie Bei", "ko": "바이애슬론의 역사 - 군사 순찰 기원에서 현대 월드컵까지"}'::jsonb,
